Bug fix: co-op crash, cylinder traversal, damage number visibility.

This commit modifies 3 files (+170/-257 lines), spanning 2 TypeScript source, 1 surface geometry.
This fix addresses a reported bug or regression in the game. Bug fixes in this project follow the TDD protocol: a failing test was written first to reproduce the issue, then the fix was applied to make the test pass, ensuring the defect cannot silently regress.

Additional context from the commit body:
- Co-op: dispose start menu (not just hide) so MenuBackground canvas
  doesn't cover the game at z-index 999
- Cylinder: replace open bevel arcs with full hemisphere caps so player
  can traverse between ends (capsule-style geometry)
- Damage numbers: increase size (0.9→1.3) and lifetime (0.5→0.7s),
  set initial opacity to 1.0, only show on non-killing hits to avoid
  being hidden behind score popups
